Manage cross-session memory

Usage: nofy memory [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  clear  Clear memory files (workspace by default)
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --debug                 Enable debug logging
      --debug-file <FILE>     Write debug logs to FILE
  -h, --help                  Print help
      --leader-socket <PATH>  Use a custom leader socket path instead of the default `~/.nofy/leader.sock`
